ting","無障礙座位",[1,[[0,"不提供無障礙座位"]],[0,"不提供無障礙座位","無障礙座位","不提供無障礙座位"]],1,[2],0],["/geo/type/establishment_poi/has_wheelchair_accessible_parking","無障礙停車場",[1,[[0,"不提供無障礙停車場"]],[0,"不提供無障礙停車場","無障礙停車場","不提供無障礙停車場"]],1,[2],0]]]]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"zh-TW",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[["赤羽拉麵 ラーメン Ramen Akabane","https://lh5.googleusercontent.com/-S0XC1_cTwAY/AAAAAAAAAAI/AAAAAAAAAAA/6YoOFMPHZb4/s40-c-k-mo/photo.jpg"],[[null,[[["今天來了一對背包客情侶，一進門就笑著問我：「你確定好吃嗎？」我回答：「Of course。」\n在我的推薦下，他們點了赤鬼海鮮豚骨拉麵、黑蒜鴨胸拉麵，還有唐揚炸雞沙拉。吃完後，他們臉上的滿足與笑容就是最真實的回饋。\n我邀請他們留下評論，他們立刻掃描QR Code，還主動一起合照留念。\n有時候，和客人的互動會讓我想起以前在機艙工作的日子，但現在不只是服務，更是透過一碗拉麵，帶給客人一段記憶。\n離開前我對他們說：「Gracias！」他們笑著回：「下次來台灣一定會再回來！」\n來自西班牙的他們，與台灣的我們，因為一碗拉麵而相遇。\n\nToday, a backpacking couple walked in and playfully asked, “Are you sure it’s good?”\nI smiled and said, “Of course.”\nThey ordered our Akaoni Seafood Tonkotsu Ramen, Black Garlic Duck Breast Ramen, and Karaage Chicken Salad.\nThe smiles on their faces after finishing said everything — pure satisfaction.\nWhen I invited them to leave a review, they immediately scanned the QR code and even asked to take a photo together.\nMoments like this remind me of my days as cabin crew. But now, it’s more than service — it’s about creating memories through a bowl of ramen.\nBefore leaving, I said “Gracias!”\nThey replied, “We’ll definitely come back next time we visit Taiwan!”\nTwo places, far apart in the world, connected by a simple bowl of ramen.\nMoments like this truly make it all worthwhile.",1]]],[1777274552,1793085752],null,null,[["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/geougc/AF1QipORTDHW4Hei3jJZ_fecal55h68oLNoFLcot_-gW\u003dh400-no",1,null,"","AF1QipORTDHW4Hei3jJZ_fecal55h68oLNoFLcot_-gW"]],"6146081256686643537","8270955745292171165",["https://www.google.com/search?sca_esv\u003dc8557b5bb6b82d6c\u0026authuser\u003d0\u0026hl\u003dzh-TW\u0026gl\u003dtw\u0026output\u003dsearch\u0026q\u003d%E8%B5%A4%E7%BE%BD%E6%8B%89%E9%BA%B5+%E3%83%A9%E3%83%BC%E3%83%A1%E3%83%B3+Ramen+Akabane\u0026ludocid\u003d6790775583011295407\u0026lpsid\u003dCIHM0ogKELL2sa6tn8zC4gE\u0026ibp\u003dgwp;0,10#lpstate\u003dpid:CIHM0ogKELL2sa6tn8zC4gE,ar","/gmb/local_post/accounts%2F-%2Flocations%2F8270955745292171165%2FlocalPosts%2F6146081256686643537/version/1777274551885000","https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCNHS-YvvitGlVRIXQ0lITTBvZ0tFTEwyc2E2dG44ekM0Z0UaEkNnc0l1SjI4endZUTBKZmFiQQ\u0026d\u003d286732320\u0026t\u003d20"],"https://search.google.com/local/posts?q\u003d%E8%B5%A4%E7%BE%BD%E6%8B%89%E9%BA%B5+%E3%83%A9%E3%83%BC%E3%83%A1%E3%83%B3+Ramen+Akabane\u0026ludocid\u003d6790775583011295407\u0026lpsid\u003dCIHM0ogKELL2sa6tn8zC4gE\u0026source\u003dsh/x/loc/post\u0026lsig\u003dAB86z5UgGicOFkL7AeK3xB7YpziE","0ahUKEwjKvZPO89SWAxUgJzQIHeAOJToQ544CCCgoHA",null,"2026年4月27日",null,null,1,null,null,"https://business.google.com/mm/posts/l/u8270955745292171165/delete?s\u003dEAA%3D\u0026ih\u003dtactile\u0026p\u003dChM2MTQ2MDgxMjU2Njg2NjQzNTM3","https://business.google.com/mm/posts/l/u8270955745292171165/edit?s\u003dEAA%3D\u0026ih\u003dtactile\u0026p\u003dChM2MTQ2MDgxMjU2Njg2NjQzNTM3",null,null,null,null,null,["6146081256686643537","CIHM0ogKELL2sa6tn8zC4gE","CgsIuJ28zwYQ0JfabA"]],[null,[[["平常日的迪化街，人潮會慢慢退去，街道變得安靜許多。但有時候，店裡卻會出現一種讓人特別開心的畫面——一群高中生進來，接著又一群，再接著又一群（我一度以為是不是校外教學改來吃拉麵了😂）。\n\n看著他們邊聊天邊吃麵，有人專心到完全不講話，有人第一口就眼睛亮起來，還有人默默把湯喝到見底。離開前丟下一句：「老闆，真的很好吃欸！」那一瞬間，比營業額還讓人滿足。\n\n也許對他們來說，只是一碗平凡的拉麵。但對我來說，那是一段會被記住的青春片段。\n\n所以我們在想——是不是該為這些用笑容支持我們的學生們，做點什麼。\n\n📣 近期正在規劃「學生限定優惠」讓你們在課業與未來的壓力之間，至少可以有一碗熱騰騰的拉麵，稍微喘口氣。\n\n（放心，份量不會變少，青春需要補充熱量😆）\n\n敬請期待。也歡迎繼續帶著同學一起來，把店裡變成最吵最熱鬧的地方。",1]]],[1777024679,1792835879],null,null,[["https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/geougc/AF1QipPhzRNiD6oaMeCLOzTwD_jJbDjPVznvenYyv6ya\u003dh400-no",1,null,"","AF1QipPhzRNiD6oaMeCLOzTwD_jJbDjPVznvenYyv6ya"]],"2480286305117840426","8270955745292171165",["https://www.google.com/search?sca_esv\u003dc8557b5bb6b82d6c\u0026authuser\u003d0\u0026hl\u003dzh-TW\u0026gl\u003dtw\u0026output\u003dsearch\u0026q\u003d%E8%B5%A4%E7%BE%BD%E6%8B%89%E9%BA%B5+%E3%83%A9%E3%83%BC%E3%83%A1%E3%83%B3+Ramen+Akabane\u0026ludocid\u003d6790775583011295407\u0026lpsid\u003dCIHM0ogKEObi-JPJuqzaZw\u0026ibp\u003dgwp;0,10#lpstate\u003dpid:CIHM0ogKEObi-JPJuqzaZw,ar","/gmb/local_post/accounts%2F-%2Flocations%2F8270955745292171165%2FlocalPosts%2F2480286305117840426/version/1777024678953000","https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCKrIwu6N6O-1IhIWQ0lITTBvZ0tFT2JpLUpQSnVxemFadxoTQ2d3SXBfMnN6d1lRNk15bmtnRQ\u0026d\u003d286732320\u0026t\u003d20"],"https://search.google.com/local/posts?q\u003d%E8%B5%A4%E7%BE%BD%E6%8B%89%E9%BA%B5+%E3%83%A9%E3%83%BC%E3%83%A1%E3%83%B3+Ramen+Akabane\u0026ludocid\u003d6790775583011295407\u0026lpsid\u003dCIHM0ogKEObi-JPJuqzaZw\u0026source\u003dsh/x/loc/post\u0026lsig\u003dAB86z5UgGicOFkL7AeK3xB7YpziE","0ahUKEwjKvZPO89SWAxUgJzQIHeAOJToQ544CCCkoHQ",null,"2026年4月24日",null,null,1,null,null,"https://business.google.com/mm/posts/l/u8270955745292171165/delete?s\u003dEAA%3D\u0026ih\u003dtactile\u0026p\u003dChMyNDgwMjg2MzA1MTE3ODQwNDI2","https://business.google.com/mm/posts/l/u8270955745292171165/edit?s\u003dEAA%3D\u0026ih\u003dtactile\u0026p\u003dChMyNDgwMjg2MzA1MTE3ODQwNDI2",null,null,null,null,null,["2480286305117840426","CIHM0ogKEObi-JPJuqzaZw","CgwIp_2szwYQ6MynkgE"]]],1],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,0,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[9],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[["還記得在 2002 年，我踏上日本留學之旅。\n有一次，無意間在電視節目《電視冠軍》上看到一場拉麵排行榜比賽，從第 10 名到第 1 名依序揭曉。令人驚喜的是—第 1 名的拉麵店，竟然就在我住的赤羽車站附近！\n\n懷著滿心期待，我搭上電車前往那家傳說中的名店。到達時，門口早已大排長龍，我也乖乖跟著排了三個小時。終於嘗到這碗被譽為「第一名」的拉麵時，我的第一個感覺卻是：味道太濃厚了，似乎並不符合我從小習慣的口味。\n\n身為臺灣人雙親也已經年邁不適合重鹹，我們更偏好清爽、健康、能常常吃也不膩的風味。於是，在回到臺灣後，我開始嘗試自己研發一款「改良式拉麵」——希望能讓家人朋友在享受美味的同時，也能感受到清新、溫暖與健康。\n\n這就是我與拉麵的故事。\n一碗麵，不只是味道，\n更是一段旅程、一份心意。\n希望大家也能喜歡我用心打造的這碗拉麵 🍜✨"],["https://www.google.com/local/place/rap/merchantdescription","https://support.google.com/legal/troubleshooter/1114905#ts\u003d1115658%2C1115689"]],null,